# Smart College Event Management Portal

A full-stack web application designed to simplify college event management and student participation.

## Features

- Student registration and login
- Admin and student dashboards
- Create and manage college events
- Event registration and participation
- Individual and team participation
- Team management
- QR-based attendance
- Feedback and notifications
- Certificate generation
- Event analytics and reporting

## Technology Stack

**Frontend:** React.js, HTML, CSS, JavaScript

**Backend:** Java 21, Spring Boot, REST APIs

**Database:** MySQL

**Build Tool:** Maven

## Project Structure

- `frontend/` – React.js application
- `backend/` – Spring Boot application

## Project Type

Academic Full-Stack Development Project

## Developed As

Second-Year Information Technology Engineering Mini Project

A.C. Patil College of Engineering, Kharghar

---

*This project demonstrates full-stack development, database integration, REST API development, and event management workflows.*
